  "$comment": "The queries each rendered surface reads (rulings D-35, D-48). Each key is a collected surface (parity.json `surfaces`, or `menu` for the native menu built from menu.json), and declares exactly the queries that surface sends while it opens and settles (parity.json `surfaceReads`, observed by the parity collector; C43B-R3S-01), each with the product files that call it. The gate (crates/executor/tests/common/parity_gate.rs) checks both directions per surface and against the call sites: a surface declaring a read it does not send fails, as does a query a surface sends without declaring it. Plumbing calls bind nothing.",
